{"n": 536, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "536.webp", "text": "3151010 REPLACING SHAFT SEAL\nFOR DRIVE FLANGE OF\nFRONT AXLE FINAL DRIVE\n\nRemove splash guard — see Group 51.\nRemove front propeller shaft - see\nGroup 26.\n\nDrain final drive oll.\n\nInstatiation:\nFill final drive oll**.\nTightening torque*.\n\nPull right output shaft out of front axle\nfinal drive about 15 mm (0.591\") with\nSpecial Tools 31 5 011 / 012.\n\ninstallation:\nRefer to information for output shaft.\n\nUnscrew nuts and press front axle final\ndrive away from engine oil pan about\n10 ... 15 mm (0.394 ... 0.591\").\n\nInstallation:\nTightening torque*.\n\n* See Specifications\n“* See Operating Flulds\n\n303151\n\nUnscrew bolts.\n\nInstallation\n\nFlat surface of pinion faces flat surface\non case.\n\nTightening torque*.\n\nPull pinion out of case by screwing In\ntwo M 8 x 30 bolts uniformly.\n\n'f both tapped bores are not accessible,\npinion must be knocked out of case\nwith a plastic-hammer.\n\ninstallation:\ninstall old shim (A) and new seal (1).\n\nClamp pinion in aluminum jaw vise.\nMeasure friction torque with Special\nTool 00 2 000 while turning uniformly\nand note value.\n\n* See Specifications", "words": [["3151010", 0.2786, 0.0796, 0.3293, 0.0908], ["REPLACING", 0.3369, 0.0796, 0.4022, 0.0915], ["SHAFT", 0.4058, 0.0796, 0.4428, 0.0915], ["SEAL", 0.4463, 0.0796, 0.4762, 0.0908], ["FOR", 0.3369, 0.0955, 0.3597, 0.1074], ["DRIVE", 0.3637, 0.0962, 0.3972, 0.1074], ["FLANGE", 0.4017, 0.0962, 0.4468, 0.1074], ["OF", 0.4509, 0.0962, 0.4656, 0.1074], ["FRONT", 0.3369, 0.1121, 0.3749, 0.124], ["AXLE", 0.3789, 0.1127, 0.4083, 0.124], ["FINAL", 0.4124, 0.1127, 0.4443, 0.124], ["DRIVE", 0.4483, 0.1127, 0.4823, 0.124], ["Remove", 0.2791, 0.1459, 0.3222, 0.1572], ["splash", 0.3262, 0.1459, 0.3607, 0.1598], ["guard", 0.3647, 0.1459, 0.3956, 0.1605], ["—", 0.3992, 0.1519, 0.4058, 0.1538], ["see", 0.4093, 0.1485, 0.4271, 0.1572], ["Group", 0.4311, 0.1459, 0.464, 0.1598], ["51.", 0.4681, 0.1459, 0.